<tr>
  <td align="left" style="padding: 40px 40px 48px">
    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; color: #020e1f">Delete Account Request</h1>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #020e1f">Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #020e1f">We received a request to permanently delete your Seil account.</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #020e1f">If you initiated this request, no further action is required. Your account will be deleted according to our standard process.</p>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #020e1f">If you did not request this change, please reset your password immediately or contact our <a href="{{supportUrl}}" style="color: #326ad1; text-decoration: underline">support team</a>.</p>
  </td>
</tr>
